FROM python:3.15-slim-bookworm@sha256:122756f3fe72c4f5d3d71897888204ee85774bc79de952555b8a474e1d0a5d53
ARG CAST_INSTALL_PIPER=false

ENV PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1 PIP_NO_CACHE_DIR=1
RUN apt-get update && apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends \
    ffmpeg espeak-ng fonts-dejavu-core ca-certificates \
    && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*
WORKDIR /app
COPY requirements-tls.lock ./
RUN pip install --require-hashes --only-binary=:all: -r requirements-tls.lock
COPY requirements-cast.lock requirements-piper.lock ./
COPY .github/requirements-build.txt ./requirements-build.txt
RUN pip install --require-hashes --only-binary=:all: -r requirements-build.txt && \
    if [ "$CAST_INSTALL_PIPER" = true ]; then requirements=requirements-piper.lock; else requirements=requirements-cast.lock; fi && \
    pip install --require-hashes --only-binary=:all: -r "$requirements"
COPY pyproject.toml README.md LICENSE ./
COPY igw_google_voice ./igw_google_voice
COPY blueprints ./blueprints
RUN pip install --no-deps --no-build-isolation . && \
    useradd --uid 10001 --no-create-home cast
USER 10001:10001
CMD ["igw-cast"]
